    {
      "name": "2️⃣ Quiz API",
      "description": "AI generates questions with Question IDs — no local ID generation.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 — POST /quiz/generate",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data?.quiz_questions?.length > 0) {",
                  "  const first = res.data.quiz_questions[0];",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('question_id', first.question_id);",
                  "  console.log('=== QUIZ GENERATED ===');",
                  "  console.log('Total questions:', res.data.total_questions);",
                  "  console.log('First Question ID (from AI):', first.question_id);",
                  "  console.log('First Question:', first.question_text);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Has quiz_questions', () => pm.expect(res.data.quiz_questions).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('Question IDs from AI', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(res.data.quiz_questions[0].question_id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"unique_user_id\": \"{{unique_user_id}}\",\n  \"unique_session_id\": \"{{unique_session_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/quiz/generate",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "quiz", "generate"]
            },
            "description": "## Generate Quiz\n\n**Prerequisites:** Run `/course/setup` first.\n\n**AI does internally:**\n- Fetches lecture content from `Course_lecture_generator` by `unique_session_id`\n- Generates 10 quiz questions with OpenAI GPT-4.1\n- Saves to `Quiz_question` collection\n- Returns question IDs (QID-xxx) — generated by AI, not locally\n\n### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"quiz_questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_id\": \"QID-abc123\",\n      \"question_number\": 1,\n      \"question_text\": \"What is Algebra?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        { \"option_letter\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Math branch\" },\n        { \"option_letter\": \"B\", \"text\": \"Physics law\" },\n        ...\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_questions\": 10\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 — Success",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 201,\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Quiz questions generated successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"total_questions\": 10,\n    \"quiz_questions\": [\n      {\n        \"question_id\": \"QID-abc12345\",\n        \"question_number\": 1,\n        \"question_text\": \"What is the fundamental theorem of algebra?\",\n        \"options\": [\n          { \"option_letter\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Every polynomial has at least one root\" },\n          { \"option_letter\": \"B\", \"text\": \"All numbers are integers\" },\n          { \"option_letter\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Pi is rational\" },\n          { \"option_letter\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Zero is undefined\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 — POST /quiz/submit (Answer: A)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Has is_correct', () => pm.expect(res.data).to.have.property('is_correct'));",
                  "pm.test('Has correct_answer', () => pm.expect(res.data).to.have.property('correct_answer'));",
                  "console.log('Is Correct:', res.data.is_correct);",
                  "console.log('Correct Answer:', res.data.correct_answer);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"unique_user_id\": \"{{unique_user_id}}\",\n  \"unique_session_id\": \"{{unique_session_id}}\",\n  \"question_id\": \"{{question_id}}\",\n  \"selected_answer\": \"A\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/quiz/submit",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "quiz", "submit"]
            },
            "description": "## Submit Quiz Answer\n\n**AI does internally:**\n- Validates question exists in `Quiz_question`\n- Checks if answer is correct\n- Saves to `Quiz_answer` collection\n\n### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"is_correct\": true,\n  \"correct_answer\": \"A\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Correct",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 200,\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Answer submitted successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"is_correct\": true,\n    \"correct_answer\": \"A\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 — Wrong",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 200,\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Answer submitted successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"is_correct\": false,\n    \"correct_answer\": \"B\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 — GET /quiz/results",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/quiz/results?unique_session_id={{unique_session_id}}&unique_user_id={{unique_user_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "quiz", "results"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "unique_session_id", "value": "{{unique_session_id}}"},
                {"key": "unique_user_id", "value": "{{unique_user_id}}"}
              ]
            },
            "description": "## Get Quiz Results\n\nReturns total/answered/correct counts and score percentage after answering questions.\n\n### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"total_questions\": 10,\n  \"answered_questions\": 5,\n  \"correct_answers\": 3,\n  \"score_percentage\": 60.0\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Results",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 200,\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Quiz results fetched successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"total_questions\": 10,\n    \"answered_questions\": 10,\n    \"correct_answers\": 7,\n    \"score_percentage\": 70.0\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
